# /no-human-review — Autonomous Mode Flag

Add `/no-human-review` to `/orches-sdlc` or `/orches-sdlc-jira`. Open every reply with `🧭 orchestrator`.

## What changes

- Spec approval and plan agreement still need the user.
- Build acceptance is automatic once every review approves.
- The PR is created automatically if a git host is connected. Otherwise show the title and description.

## Still stops for you

- a missing Atlassian connection, a failing test, a review still open after 3 rounds, or an ambiguous spec.

## Never

- merge, release, or push to the default branch.

## If run on its own

Ask the user for a feature description or a Jira card. Then run that flow with the flag applied.
